OL,3,GNEWSAChildren at council-run home
OL,4,Aillegally tattooed each other
OL,5,
OL,6,FYoung people at a council-owned
OL,7,Fchildren's home were found to have
OL,8,Ftattooed themselves and others with
OL,9,Fillegally bought kit, a government
OL,10,Fwatchdog found.
OL,12,FAn Ofsted inspector discovered staff at
OL,13,Fthe home in Salford had "failed to act"
OL,14,Fwhen a child repeatedly tattooed
OL,15,Fthemselves, other children in the home,
OL,16,Fand "reportedly peers in the
OL,17,Fcommunity".
OL,19,FThe home was rated 'inadequate' by
OL,20,FOfsted and handed three compliance
OL,21,Fnotices to improve children's safety
OL,22,Fand welfare.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,410,400,260,160,0,100
