OL,3,GNEWSAChildren at council-run home
OL,4,Aillegally tattooed each other
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Salford City Council spokesperson
OL,7,Fsaid: "We accepted the findings of the
OL,8,Finspection in full and have already
OL,9,Ftaken swift action to address the
OL,10,Fissues raised, resulting in recent
OL,11,Fpositive feedback from Ofsted."
